Esta es la plantilla que te recomiendo guardar. Es más completa que simplemente escribir /cinematicvideo.
MASTER VIDEO PROMPT — CINEMATOGRAPHY
01. SCENE
Describe el lugar, ambiente, época y contexto.
02. SUBJECT
Describe el personaje, objeto o elemento principal.
03. ACTION
Describe exactamente qué sucede y cómo se desarrolla la acción.
04. CAMERA
Camera: ARRI Alexa 35 / RED V-Raptor / Sony Venice 2.
05. LENS
Lens: 24mm / 35mm / 50mm / 85mm / Anamorphic.
Aperture: T2.8.
Depth of field: Shallow / Deep.
06. CAMERA MOVEMENT
Movement: Dolly in / Orbit / Tracking / Crane / Handheld.
Direction: Left / Right / Forward / Backward.
Speed: Slow / Moderate / Fast.
Trajectory: Describe the camera path.
07. SHOT SIZE
Extreme wide / Wide / Medium / Close-up / Extreme close-up.
08. LIGHTING
Soft light / Hard light / Backlight / Rim light / Volumetric lighting.
Describe direction, intensity and quality.
09. COLOR GRADING
Kodak 2383 / Teal & Orange / Neutral / Film Look.
Specify highlights, shadows and saturation.
10. MOTION
Natural movement, realistic physics, smooth transitions, consistent velocity.
11. TEMPORAL STRUCTURE
Duration: [Seconds].
Beginning: [Initial action].
Middle: [Development].
Ending: [Final action].
12. ATMOSPHERE
Fog / Rain / Dust / Smoke / Particles / Wind / Reflections.
13. SOUND DESIGN
Ambient sound / Foley / Music / Voice-over / Silence.
14. FORMAT
Aspect ratio: 16:9 / 9:16 / 1:1.
Frame rate: 24 / 25 / 30 / 60 fps.
Resolution: 1080p / 4K.
15. CONTINUITY
Maintain subject identity, object geometry, environment, lighting and visual consistency throughout the sequence.
16. NEGATIVE INSTRUCTIONS
No morphing, flickering, warping, unstable geometry, unwanted cuts, random camera movement or artificial motion.
FINAL DIRECTION
Create a coherent cinematic sequence with professional cinematography, intentional camera movement, realistic motion and carefully controlled visual storytelling.



